esponse to the recent surge in waterborne illnesses in the Karwan constituency, a special seven member team from the Hyderabad Metropolitan Water Supply and Sewerage Board (HMWSSB) has been deployed on an urgent basis. The move comes after complaints were received regarding contaminated drinking water leading to cases of vomiting, stomach pain, and other health concerns, particularly in areas served by Shaikpet and Allah Banda reservoirs.\n\n@kausarmohiuddin al Saba hotel as colony Tolichowki is causing sewage overflow river into 7tombs road; if this is not stopped it will emerge like a new musi river; u can investigate it and please take immediate action\n\nReply\n\n👑🦁👑🫡\n\nReply\n\n🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥\n\nReply\n\n👏👏👏👏🔥🔥🔥\n\nReply\n\n👏👏\n\nReply\n\nLog in to like or comment.","author":null,"published_date":"2025-07-01T16:52:19.000Z","latency_ms":8375.751037005102,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}